NOTE whats-new entry: Soccer Career: season awards you have to beat somebody for. In Soccer Career the Golden Boot, Player of the Year and the other season awards used to be a bar and a coin flip, so a 40 goal season lost the Golden Boot seven times in ten and a 24 goal one could never win it. Now every award is decided against the best rival season of that year: at a top club 40 goals wins it almost every time, 30 about half the time, and a good season can still lose to a better one. Named awards also stick to the years they were really given, so the Golden Glove starts in 2004-05 and UEFA Player of the Year runs from 2010-11 to 2022-23.
